<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Deposit not completed - CLIMBS</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .deposit-result { text-align: center; max-width: 400px; margin: 60px auto; padding: 2rem; }
        .deposit-result h1 { color: #c62828; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .deposit-result p { color: #555; margin: 1rem 0; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; padding: 12px 24px; background: #1976d2; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; }
        .btn:hover { background: #1565c0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="deposit-result">
            <h1>Payment not completed</h1>
            <p>Payment was cancelled or failed. No amount was deducted. You can try again from the dashboard.</p>
            <a href="/member-dashboard" class="btn">Back to Dashboard</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
